#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/diagrams.md:8
msgid "架构图册"
msgstr "Architecture diagram atlas"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/diagrams.md:10
msgid ""
"本页收录当前架构、目标设计与精确参考图。先读每图的范围和箭头，再核对对应代码； "
"图源存在或渲染成功不证明某种硬件模式已经实现、通过实板验证或满足性能预算。 实线和虚线的含义以各边标签为准；编译依赖不表示每次 I/O 都会经过该层。"
msgstr ""
"This page collects current architecture, target designs and exact reference "
"diagrams. Read each scope and arrow before checking its source. A diagram "
"source or successful rendering does not prove that a hardware mode is "
"implemented, physically validated or within its performance budget. Edge "
"labels define solid and dashed arrows; a build dependency does not imply an "
"extra layer on every I/O call."

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/diagrams.md:14
msgid ""
"每图维护一份 DOT 拓扑、一份 canonical SVG 预览和同名 `.labels.json`。 标签政策精确覆盖英文和中文，语言 SVG "
"由锁定工具一次生成到构建目录，站点只读选取。 图内所有权、取消、排空和失败责任在两种语言中保持一致。图的来源与范围见 {download}`图索引 "
"<../assets/diagrams/diagram-index.csv>`，维护命令见 [文档工具](documentation-"
"tools.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Each diagram maintains one DOT topology, one canonical SVG preview, and a "
"matching `.labels.json`. Label policies cover English and Chinese exactly. "
"Locked tools generate language SVGs once into the build directory, and the "
"site selects them read-only. Ownership, cancellation, draining, and failure "
"responsibilities remain identical in both languages. See the "
"{download}`diagram index <../assets/diagrams/diagram-index.csv>` for diagram"
" sources and scope, and [documentation tools](documentation-tools.md) for "
"maintenance commands."

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/diagrams.md:20
msgid "FIG-01 全平台分层与外部边界"
msgstr "FIG-01 Whole-platform layers and external boundaries"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/diagrams.md:22
msgid ""
"平台职责与产品外置；Platform 连接静态实例与共享 C 协调器，OS 和组件可选。 逐边区分构建事实与日常调用，生成器不拥有驱动状态机。"
msgstr ""
"Platform responsibilities and external product ownership; Platform connects "
"static instances with the shared C coordinator, while OS and components "
"remain optional. Edge labels distinguish build-time facts from ordinary "
"calls. The generator does not own driver state machines."

