#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/diagrams.md:37
msgid "FIG-03 配置与原子生成"
msgstr "FIG-03 Configuration and atomic generation"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/diagrams.md:39
msgid ""
"包声明、Board 与 TOML 沿同一输入快照进入通用政策与具名 IR，再形成有限静态连接 和原子 bundle。包只选择 CMake "
"入口，CMake 拥有唯一 C 源码图；失败不继续使用旧 输出或半成品。F4 的 `facts/` 与相邻领域 binding 通过 manifest "
"显式选择，全部 箭头表示构建期数据或产物依赖。"
msgstr ""
"The package declaration, Board and TOML enter generic policies and named IR "
"through one input snapshot, then form bounded static connections and an "
"atomic bundle. The package only selects a CMake entry; CMake owns the sole C"
" source graph. Failure never continues with stale or partial output. The "
"manifest explicitly selects F4 facts under `facts/` and adjacent domain "
"bindings. Every arrow denotes build-time data or artifact dependencies."

