#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/diagrams.md:56
msgid "FIG-05 显式启动停机与失败撤回"
msgstr "FIG-05 Explicit start, stop and failure cleanup"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/diagrams.md:58
msgid ""
"运行期由共享 C 协调器先检查上下文，再完成全部 controller 准入，之后才取得 "
"System、共享资源与实例。共享资源／实例失败执行逆序回滚；System 启动结果分别 报告 primary、cleanup 和残效。释放失败保留具体"
" owner 收条与存储，不能超时强收。"
msgstr ""
"At runtime the shared C coordinator checks context and completes every "
"controller admission before acquiring System, shared resources and "
"instances. Shared-resource or instance failure triggers reverse rollback. "
"System startup separately reports primary, cleanup and retained effects. A "
"failed release retains the concrete owner's receipts and storage; timeout "
"cannot force reclamation."

