#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/diagrams.md:164
msgid "FIG-27 统一 OS 源码接口的当前构建依赖"
msgstr "FIG-27 Current build dependencies for the unified OS source interface"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/diagrams.md:166
msgid ""
"当前任务后端的构建结构。箭头表示构建期依赖，包含编译依赖和链接时的实现选择； 每幅镜像选择一个任务后端，虚线表示可选扩展或按后端需要的依赖。 "
"业务依赖公共接口，装配侧持有选定后端的静态布局；图中不增加运行时转发层、对象池或 worker。 "
"设计与退出条件分别见[架构方案](../explanation/os-portability.md)和 "
"[实施清单](../development/os-portability-plan.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Build structure of the current task backends. Arrows show build-time "
"dependencies, including compilation dependencies and implementation "
"selection at link time. Each image selects one task backend; dashed edges "
"are optional extensions or dependencies required by that backend. Business "
"code uses public interfaces; assembly code owns the selected backend's "
"static layout. The diagram adds no runtime forwarding layer, object pool or "
"worker. See the [architecture](../explanation/os-portability.md) and "
"[implementation checklist](../development/os-portability-plan.md) for the "
"design and exit conditions."

