#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/diagrams.md:176
msgid "FIG-31 F4 源码归属与接口边界"
msgstr "FIG-31: F4 source ownership and interface boundaries"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/diagrams.md:178
msgid ""
"包内 `facts/`、相邻 binding、Board 和 TOML 由通用配置器生成静态实例与固定连接。 `system/` "
"拥有系统与共享生命周期，`drivers/<domain>/` 拥有控制器行为，`sdk/` 选择私有官方库。虚线是构建／测试依赖，实线是公共 I/O "
"调用；图不增加运行时层， 也不把参考模型提升为生产或实板资格。"
msgstr ""
"The generic configurator turns package-local `facts/`, adjacent bindings, "
"Board and TOML into static instances and fixed connections. `system/` owns "
"system mechanisms and the shared lifecycle; `drivers/<domain>/` owns "
"controller behavior; `sdk/` selects private official libraries. Dashed edges"
" denote build/test dependencies and solid edges denote public I/O calls. The"
" diagram adds no runtime layer and does not promote reference models to "
"production or physical qualification."

