#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/diagrams.md:205
msgid "FIG-34 控制与智能器件的执行和退出"
msgstr "FIG-34 Execution and shutdown for control and smart devices"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/diagrams.md:207
msgid ""
"实线表示调用或执行，虚线表示借用或退出责任。应用选择慢路径组件和精确快环模式， 提供执行者与全部存储；既有 I/O face 进入唯一硬件 "
"provider。ADC IRQ 只运行已预算 的 compute，不调用 GUI、网络或存储。停止输出与借用退出分别证明，失败保留原引用。 "
"图表达当前软件组合，不把全部可选路径变成默认层，也不授予实板或电机控制资格。 使用步骤见[控制与智能器件](../guides/control-and-"
"smart-devices.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Solid edges represent calls or execution; dashed edges represent borrowing "
"or shutdown duties. The application selects slow-path components and an "
"exact fast-loop mode, supplying executors and all storage. Existing I/O "
"faces enter the sole hardware provider. The ADC IRQ runs only budgeted "
"compute, never GUI, networking or storage. Prove output inhibition and "
"borrow withdrawal separately; failure retains original references. The "
"diagram describes current software composition without making every optional"
" path mandatory or granting hardware or motor-control qualification. See "
"[control and smart devices](../guides/control-and-smart-devices.md) for the "
"steps."

