#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/diagrams.md:217
msgid "图资源维护"
msgstr "Diagram asset maintenance"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/diagrams.md:219
msgid ""
"每图维护 `.dot`、`.svg` 和 `.labels.json` 同名三件套，图索引完整登记。 标签文件使用 `schema_version: "
"1`、`en`、`zh_CN`；两种语言精确覆盖本图全部标签。 缺失、多余、重复或空白翻译均失败，不使用全局词典或未翻译回退。 "
"原本为空的布局标签可以明确保留空字符串。"
msgstr ""
"Each diagram maintains matching `.dot`, `.svg`, and `.labels.json` files and"
" a complete diagram-index entry. Label files use `schema_version: 1`, `en`, "
"and `zh_CN`; both languages cover every label in that diagram exactly. "
"Missing, extra, duplicate, or blank translations fail. No global dictionary "
"or untranslated fallback is used. Layout labels that were originally empty "
"may explicitly retain an empty string."

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/diagrams.md:224
msgid ""
"编辑后使用已准备的锁定工具生成预览并运行文档检查。Graphviz、字体和依赖身份 由工具环境校验；SVG "
"内嵌字形，拒绝外部资源和活动内容。正式构建在一次资产阶段 生成所选语言图，Sphinx 只读使用构建目录。不要在源码中维护另一套语言 DOT／SVG， "
"也不要把图源配对和渲染成功当成架构语义或实板验证。"
msgstr ""
"After editing, generate previews with the prepared locked tools and run "
"documentation checks. The tool environment verifies Graphviz, fonts, and "
"dependency identities. SVGs embed glyphs and reject external resources and "
"active content. A formal build generates selected-language diagrams in one "
"asset stage; Sphinx consumes the build directory read-only. Do not maintain "
"another set of language DOT/SVG files in source, or treat source pairing and"
" successful rendering as architecture-semantic or physical verification."
